  "name": "ANCS Canvas",
  "status": "IMPLEMENTATION_REFERENCE_NOT_INTEGRATED",
  "source": "ANCS_AI_Native_v0.4.md §29, superseded in part by docs/decisions/0019-stitch-canvas-design-language.md (owner request: follow Google Stitch interaction and visual language)",
  "appearance": {
